  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chicken tikka jalfrezi is a fast, stir-fried curry with charred meat and soft peppers in a spiced tomato sauce. It is lighter and drier than a korma or tikka masala. Keep the heat high when the chicken goes in or you will steam rather than char it."}]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {"level": 2},
        "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "What you need"}]
      },
